WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:01.543
Hi, I'm Tim Robinson.

00:00:01.626 --> 00:00:05.046
You might remember me from
<i>SNL</i> and<i> Detroiters.</i>

00:00:05.422 --> 00:00:08.174
I'm proud to announce
my new sketch comedy show,

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:10.468
<i>I Think You Should Leave,</i>
is coming to Netflix.

00:00:10.552 --> 00:00:12.887
In this show,
people get a little embarrassed

00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:14.806
and then very angry.

00:00:14.889 --> 00:00:17.600 position:66%
And the guest stars include Cecily Strong,

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:19.686
Will Forte, Sam Richardson,

00:00:19.769 --> 00:00:21.354
Patti Harrison, Tim Heidecker

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:22.564
and many, many more.

00:00:22.647 --> 00:00:23.857
But inside...

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:27.110
I am actually really, really sad.

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:30.196
And I use comedy as a tool

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:32.991
to fight the resentment
I have towards my dad.

00:00:33.074 --> 00:00:34.743
My dad and I didn't have
a good relationship

00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:36.953
because he was nasty to me.

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.121
But I showed him.

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:39.831
I learned how to have a show

00:00:39.914 --> 00:00:41.332
where people get
a little embarrassed

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:43.084
and then very, very angry.

00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:45.462
Where the guest stars include
Fred Willard,

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:47.797
Vanessa Bayer, Andy Samberg,

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.883
Kate Berlant and many, many more.

00:00:49.966 --> 00:00:52.135
Hey, buddy! I got your hoagie.

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:54.888 position:66%
Dad, I didn't ask you for a hoagie, did I?

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:56.431
I asked you...

00:00:56.514 --> 00:00:59.642
for an onion sandwich
with chicken pepper bread.

00:00:59.976 --> 00:01:01.519
Oh, sorry, pal.

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:03.146
I love you, son.

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:05.899
I love you too, Dad,
and I'm very proud of ya!

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:07.734
And the man I've become?

00:01:07.817 --> 00:01:09.068
And the man you've become.

00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:11.821
Now go get me an onion sandwich
with chicken pepper bread.

00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:13.740
You fuckin' idiot.

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:17.368
I guess I just believe
everybody in this world's

00:01:17.452 --> 00:01:18.745
got a little bit of good in them.

00:01:18.953 --> 00:01:20.330
And a little bit of bad.

00:01:21.706 --> 00:01:23.041
That's probably why I...

00:01:23.124 --> 00:01:25.084 position:59%
sometimes wear this Yin-Yang necklace.

